{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國「水彈女神」權恩妃健康亮紅燈！她近日與歌手任瑟雍合作歌曲，也上對方的YouTube頻道，未料節目中透露自己罹患耳石症，甚至只要稍微甩頭就會頭痛，讓任瑟雍聽了相當驚訝，也提醒她別為了減肥過度勉強自己。</p><p>自爆耳石症症狀嚴重　甩頭就痛無法跳舞如昔</p><p>任瑟雍11月23日在個人YouTube頻道公開新影片，標題為「為什麼會和權恩妃在江原道見面？！」，找來上個月才合作推出雙人歌曲《Vibes》的權恩妃一同入鏡，兩人也特地前往江原道拍攝。節目中權恩妃聊到自己的身體狀況：「以前跳舞時，我很會甩頭，但最近只要一甩頭就會頭痛。」她也懷疑是耳石症造成的影響。</p><figure><img alt=\"最近權恩妃（左）跟任瑟雍一起推出歌曲。（Instagram@wkorea）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261124/1201940918316306432271984.jpeg/IgBheMoL3P3-JXA5lo1fHkj3PhoqnhWUMDXs-TA17Pk\"/><figcaption>最近權恩妃（左）跟任瑟雍一起推出歌曲。（Instagram@wkorea）</figcaption></figure><p>更多權恩妃的相片：</p><figure><img alt=\"權恩妃（Instagram@silver_rain.__）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261124/1201941399478472704615732.jpeg/-n7m-vpNzT62jSpO_oldWqeft7fYVj_ju8FU3LvBVNw\"/><figcaption>權恩妃（Instagram@silver_rain.__）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"權恩妃（Instagram@silver_rain.__）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261124/1201941402070683648062583.jpeg/q52Tb3RgogPN3gsKaAgbIZdn3A5QavGrU23QQFNt0EA\"/><figcaption>權恩妃（Instagram@silver_rain.__）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"權恩妃（Instagram@silver_rain.__）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261124/1201941404415430656913702.jpeg/fD0VQWQj-YKPK72co91NVFtyllwmiyauWAtKbVgLSm0\"/><figcaption>權恩妃（Instagram@silver_rain.__）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173588812233052160314659.jpeg/Ku90cJZh3btpR3x1vODNy4PetKJ3W-ITa7Bn9WuwZ_U\"/><figcaption>權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173588814468747264895324.jpeg/k7Y8enAP4M9rhSpsk2RUBl5BquxP9uWfHRZACR0WQAk\"/><figcaption>權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173588806897635328752389.jpeg/iOYpOohTAMMqtyMkTUIlFOf-Xwtf7kGjki7F9JIuxfQ\"/><figcaption>權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173588806830919680621087.jpeg/5T8-nu17iqJElOK7v21N34Y-TaE2L-fPE6mikROpopE\"/><figcaption>權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173588808957169664254871.jpeg/wLAOGJL6yMWrFUtkRNLlnEj5U239Eoj9DmAx2w5gMds\"/><figcaption>權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173588804255092736924316.jpeg/O7TMwuBgwM9BGWa9ja8URADomDetf_Fj4W7ttuFu7bY\"/><figcaption>權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173588804679110656210634.jpeg/wlhN7ao9aKZ8DnItcABm33yndVvQtuwbyKLiZ8ii4mc\"/><figcaption>權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173588800320966656360742.jpeg/o_CQzT9zkn0UCWrxE4ySkaOy1fSZyIAZS4FG2EuBRtg\"/><figcaption>權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173588801780977664236714.jpeg/zRxsmuNqxNdUC8VObOMnIy7nggbz_jNACuL4owri-KM\"/><figcaption>權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173588802531495936985061.jpeg/S-Z-JREo8DTKmW96PHyMSS0_DegtXrZi9Xhg3vV4YN4\"/><figcaption>權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173588795380076544983071.jpeg/RZd4xGiUceuepw6knV81R3Digl4eDtpLLbDdeS2w3Xk\"/><figcaption>權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173588797502525440395784.jpeg/OsMYnaTzoFASPk_1EwzM4eEJhpIzhyVQwSlOp8EpTqc\"/><figcaption>權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173588797997191168837091.jpeg/fIIPhN3sYTAXDuRF1imLdvcmjUO33Pnb_joftP46H7Q\"/><figcaption>權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173588791185772544937504.jpeg/2n6c_Qe3CP5MmGiOzW1MM_w4ICh9kjB948IcNuPCHDY\"/><figcaption>權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173588793098244096790316.jpeg/3HZfyiDdRmUG32SIE1pC_M-n2iQ8uAjkDvGZeQ7xmXk\"/><figcaption>權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173588793505353728508174.jpeg/zrspGw1oQx9OwLRCi6N85OYTdFJ_d79U6_-ASuv_gEo\"/><figcaption>權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173588788656476160176984.jpeg/0r7i4lmabTYPNWcv1jaANoJa9DJ3uM-tpKDyMKSg8jA\"/><figcaption>權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173588418517536768937261.jpeg/QcF7-ONE2T2Zsr-7lYhhgdCZqVNIiAzZbAaceGwGnHg\"/><figcaption>權恩妃（IG＠silver_rain.__）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"權恩妃（Instagram@silver_rain.__）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260906/1173308888570138624821974.jpeg/cc21ZgpfyX-X9BwESgGd-KD50J7xgtoGgTzCLYE8wi0\"/><figcaption>權恩妃（Instagram@silver_rain.__）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"權恩妃（Instagram@silver_rain.__）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260906/1173308882907566080014926.jpeg/l-CzGyATEJzzbX8W-_HnO2oFSTUMSW2L26WgGtuloBo\"/><figcaption>權恩妃（Instagram@silver_rain.__）</figcaption></figure><p>權恩妃進一步表示，以前不管怎麼甩頭都能扭得很順，但最近只要稍微晃一下就會頭痛。任瑟雍聽到後相當驚訝，忍不住確認：「妳得了耳石症嗎？我媽媽也得過耳石症，妳現在也有嗎？」權恩妃則坦承：「我的耳石症很嚴重。」讓人更加擔心她的健康狀況。</p><p>任瑟雍心疼喊話別過度減肥　提醒她好好照顧身體</p><p>看到權恩妃受到疾病困擾，任瑟雍認為她可能是因為太操勞才導致身體出狀況，忍不住提醒她：「現在已經不能不好好管理身體，還一直減肥。」他也建議權恩妃應該依照自己的年齡與身體狀況安排工作行程，不要一直勉強自己，同時也要確保充足睡眠，字字句句流露出對她健康的關心。</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀：權恩妃驚傳「臉部嚴重灼傷」　挑戰非洲最高峰出事　傷勢照曝光】權恩妃近日登頂非洲最高峰吉力馬札羅山後，臉部遭嚴重曬傷。（IG@silver_rain.__）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260205/1096070339412103168586731.jpeg/dEC6pp0HyOfGnPEch8dBQL2ocM_Drvg5YtKhiGLSoYg\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：權恩妃驚傳「臉部嚴重灼傷」　挑戰非洲最高峰出事　傷勢照曝光】權恩妃近日登頂非洲最高峰吉力馬札羅山後，臉部遭嚴重曬傷。（IG@silver_rain.__）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"權恩妃近日登頂非洲最高峰吉力馬札羅山後，臉部遭嚴重曬傷。（IG@silver_rain.__）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260205/1096070342071422976587134.jpeg/fABuZpws-c_TYBcFaym1_GyEFmgMzTF3d53tvXed7b0\"/><figcaption>權恩妃近日登頂非洲最高峰吉力馬札羅山後，臉部遭嚴重曬傷。（IG@silver_rain.__）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"權恩妃近日登頂非洲最高峰吉力馬札羅山後，臉部遭嚴重曬傷。（IG@silver_rain.__）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260205/1096070344537804800481735.jpeg/RPxcFKY1fSlA2Qq6fZqfg8wiYegYwN03n47iF5-O4hc\"/><figcaption>權恩妃近日登頂非洲最高峰吉力馬札羅山後，臉部遭嚴重曬傷。（IG@silver_rain.__）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"權恩妃近日登頂非洲最高峰吉力馬札羅山後，臉部遭嚴重曬傷。（IG@silver_rain.__）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260205/1096070346739945472714523.jpeg/jkMVS4VuTFfyVa5gksnhXRK4i9Z6bI0z8zqau_M6mrs\"/><figcaption>權恩妃近日登頂非洲最高峰吉力馬札羅山後，臉部遭嚴重曬傷。（IG@silver_rain.__）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"權恩妃近日登頂非洲最高峰吉力馬札羅山後，臉部遭嚴重曬傷。（IG@silver_rain.__）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260205/1096070349009195008250897.jpeg/99Znen4fxU7mJJ5mi2XtWT4JujW7__yef8aGa3_Ghms\"/><figcaption>權恩妃近日登頂非洲最高峰吉力馬札羅山後，臉部遭嚴重曬傷。（IG@silver_rain.__）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"權恩妃近日登頂非洲最高峰吉力馬札羅山後，臉部遭嚴重曬傷。（IG@silver_rain.__）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260205/1096070338925563904425873.jpeg/vAzEVPdDocjXNasDJX8NFgxpn2ne2W91oJLa_6CS2v8\"/><figcaption>權恩妃近日登頂非洲最高峰吉力馬札羅山後，臉部遭嚴重曬傷。（IG@silver_rain.__）</figcaption></figure><p>酒駕9天後現身…高庚杓認了：喝很多　「撞傷清潔員」警方研議追加罪名</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T13:43:55.391536+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1528,"images":30,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T13:30:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T14:17:32.214874+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T13:37:25.064203+00:00","content_hash":"c25ec30833650b5b3df788ed1c58de4bf162c38a0b9447b86020865145af655f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}